an><span style=\"color:#000\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#800\">## default 6 x 6 trap grid</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>tmp1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scenarios</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrepl </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> trapset </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> traps1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scenarios </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scen1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">args </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">g0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> extractfn </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coef</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## selecting one coefficient (i.e. one row in coef table)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tmp1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> parameter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;g0.bTRUE&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Murray<br><br>On Friday, November 17, 2017 at 7:33:36 AM UTC+13, mayank wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hi Murray and Others<br>Could you help me how to write extractfn for covariate coefficients.<br>I would like to run D~elv+ruggedness model with 50 simulation/bootstrap in sim.secr function, also I would like to see the beta coefficients for each simulation. How to get that?<br></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
